        TextBox("temperature"),
        LineBreak(),

        Text("Enter pH"),
        TextBox("pH"),
        LineBreak(),

        Text("Enter Salinity in ppt"),
        TextBox("salinity"),
        LineBreak(),

        Button("Submit", process_matches)
    ])

5. One important consideration about your data
Your location list contains measurements for different locations, which is great.

However, make sure:

All temperatures are in Fahrenheit.

All pH measurements use the same measurement method.

All salinity measurements use the same units (your labels currently say ppt).

Your reference measurements correspond to the same sampling period as the user's sample.

Also, your current matching system requires all three measurements to be within the specified tolerances. This could exclude a location that is a very close match overall but slightly outside one tolerance.

